/* =========================================================
   v170 — HARD LAYOUT RESET / DESKTOP ADMIN GRID
   Replaces fragile fixed-sidebar + padded-parent layout.
   Desktop = explicit 2-column grid:
     [sticky sidebar] [sticky command bar + dashboard content]
   ========================================================= */

